    "Boring Tracker": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Boring Tracker"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Boring Tracker writes down numbers: calories and protein, your weight, pushups, the last time you changed a filter. Type a number, done. My goal is for it to behave like a built-in iOS app — minimum clicks, minimum wait, and no barcode to scan for a dish you cooked yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Boring Tracker permet de noter des nombres : calories, protéines, poids, pompes ou dernière fois que vous avez changé un filtre. Saisissez un nombre, c’est fait. Mon objectif est de proposer une application aussi simple qu’une app iOS intégrée : un minimum de gestes et d’attente, sans code-barres à scanner pour un plat fait maison."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calories": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calories"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calories in kcal, protein in g, weight in kg. A unit is optional.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Calories en kcal, protéines en g, poids en kg. L’unité est facultative."
          }
        }
      }
    },
