    "System": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System follows the phone, including its own per-app setting. This is stored on this device only — it is not part of your data and does not export.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le mode Système suit les réglages du téléphone, y compris ceux de cette application. Ce choix reste sur cet appareil et ne fait pas partie des données exportées."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + the first time you do it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez + la première fois que vous le faites."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap + to add the first %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez + pour ajouter une première entrée à « %@ »."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a row to edit it, or swipe to delete.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Touchez une ligne pour la modifier, ou balayez-la pour la supprimer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ are removed for good. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les %@ sont supprimées définitivement. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ stay in your data and in any export, but nothing in the app will show them once the tracker is gone. This cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les %@ restent dans vos données et vos exports, mais l’application ne les affichera plus après la suppression du suivi. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The document saved before the last import could not be read.%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le document sauvegardé avant le dernier import est illisible.%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The files that wouldn't open were kept at %@ and the app started fresh. Nothing was deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les fichiers illisibles ont été conservés dans %@ et l’application est repartie à zéro. Rien n’a été supprimé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name is what you ate, not what it counts towards. The time defaults to now — change it to log something you forgot.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le nom désigne ce que vous avez mangé. L’heure est celle du moment : modifiez-la pour ajouter un oubli."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected file is not a valid Boring Tracker export or is damaged.%@": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier sélectionné est endommagé ou n’est pas un export Boring Tracker valide.%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The store file couldn't be read, so the previous copy was used. Anything logged in the last moments before that may be missing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le fichier de données étant illisible, la copie précédente a été utilisée. Les toutes dernières entrées peuvent manquer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These entries have different names or times. Saving will use the name and time shown here for the whole batch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces entrées ont des noms ou des heures différents. L’enregistrement appliquera le nom et l’heure affichés à tout le lot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This export is internally inconsistent: %@ Nothing was changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cet export est incohérent : %@ Aucune modification n’a été effectuée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This export uses schema version %lld, but this app supports version %lld and has no safe migration for it. Nothing was changed.": {
